                                "sense_id": "12e9b6b6-9a9b-3477-9c61-28cb9fa8b387",
                                "text": "[If you] wear Capri or cropped pants, they should hit 4 to 6 inches above the ankle, depending on your height."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd942728-fb64-44cb-94d7-b266d7d1c699",
                                "sense_id": "12e9b6b6-9a9b-3477-9c61-28cb9fa8b387",
                                "text": "Wear pants or jeans that have a flare on the bottom. A flared leg draws the eye away from your hips and creates a more flattering line for your whole body. Conversely, stay away from capri or tapered pants. They drive the eye right to[…]"
                            },
                            {
